# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# --------------------------
# The app uses clean URLs (BrowserRouter), so the edge knows nothing about
# /services or /team — only index.html exists on disk. This rule hands every
# path to the app and lets React Router decide.
#
# It is load-bearing, not a convenience: delete it and a hard refresh or an
# inbound link to anything but "/" returns a real 404 — which is precisely
# what a search engine would crawl.
